  "ingredients": [
    "6 ounce cream cheese (softened)",
    "3 tablespoon erythritol (powdered)",
    "1 tablespoon heavy cream",
    "1/2 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "2 cup almond flour",
    "1/2 cup erythritol",
    "1/4 cup unflavored low-carb protein powder",
    "2 teaspoon baking powder",
    "2 teaspoon pumpkin pie spice",
    "1/2 teaspoon salt",
    "2 large egg",
    "1/2 cup pumpkin puree",
    "1/4 cup butter (melted)",
    "1/4 cup unsweetened almond milk",
    "1/2 teaspoon vanilla extract"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Mix all of the cream cheese filling ingredients until a smooth batter forms.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pumpkin-muffins-with-cream-cheese-filling/#wprm-recipe-53024-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/05/pumpkin-cream-cheese-muffin-02.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 325 degrees Fahrenheit and line a muffin tin with paper liners. You could also use silicone. In a medium bowl, whisk together the almond flour, sweetener, protein powder, baking powder, pumpkin pie spice, and salt.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pumpkin-muffins-with-cream-cheese-filling/#wprm-recipe-53024-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/05/pumpkin-cream-cheese-muffin-03.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix in the eggs, pumpkin puree, melted butter, almond milk, and vanilla extract. Mix until well combined.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pumpkin-muffins-with-cream-cheese-filling/#wprm-recipe-53024-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/05/pumpkin-cream-cheese-muffin-05.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add a spoonful of batter into each muffin well, then use a spoon to create a dent for the cream cheese filling in each muffin. Add spoonfuls of filling to the center of each, then top the muffins with a little more batter.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pumpkin-muffins-with-cream-cheese-filling/#wprm-recipe-53024-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/05/pumpkin-cream-cheese-muffin-08.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake for 25 minutes, or until the muffins are cooked in the middle. Allow to cool before removing the muffins from the tray.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pumpkin-muffins-with-cream-cheese-filling/#wprm-recipe-53024-step-0-4",
